Update 2.0.0:
    Feat:
        - Rework of the player hand UI
        - Add FQ resources to the player hand
        - Rework of the play-card dialog UI
        - Add FQ resources and targets to the play-card dialog
        - Show FQ resources directly in the play dialog and in the hand-container
        - Cards are generated dynamically from the FQ card form via an SVG
        - Cards have a defined class that changes the texture
        - Localization (FR and EN) of all cards
        - Rework of the illustrations of all playable cards
        - New FX handling (with JB2A) and original sounds (several sounds per damage type)
        - A passive spell can only be played once per turn
        - A base spell does not necessarily stay in hand -> coupled with replayable
        - GM macro to generate a deck with all cards
    Chore:
        - Version bump 14.365
        - Refactor FQ templates and objects wired to DND5E objects (character sheets) and Foundry (cards and decks)
        - Refactor classes and static methods to keep only the strict minimum
        - Macro to generate a deck with all cards
        - Vitest migration
    Fix:
        - Fix creation of a unique deck per player with their class cards
        - Fix minion summoning
        - Fix several cards: 'Enchanted Whip', 'Rock Throw', 'Shadow Spell'

Update 1.1.1:
    Chore:
        - Version bump 13.350
    Fix:
        - Players can no longer play their weapons outside their turn
        - If xvalue or yvalue is set to currentDrop, clear it for the character
        - Stop using game.actors.get to avoid decorrelation, use only token ids for targets
        - Fix Charge: did not work, .from() is deprecated, use .copySprite() + use the GM targets
        - Add missing effect messages for Guardian and Elementalist
        - Fix Open/Create Deck Macros
        - Fix base cards in generated decks

Update 1.1.0:
    Feat:
        - Add 2 new classes : The Witch and the Guardian
        - Handle Advancements up to level 20
        - Implements cards up to level 7
        - Refactor form to implements cards
        - New type of cards: Base Cards
        - Handle visual and sound effect with Sequencer, J2BA and DAE
        - Handle special attributes for Witch : Skeleton sacrifice
        - Shortcuts to use first equipped weapons and sacrifice skeleton
        - Handle first special targeting: skeleton
        - Restrict HUD for players
        - Show max number and level of cards
        - Distinct deux type of deck: FQ Library and FQ Deck
        - FQ Library can't be populated by cards from other source
        - FQ Deck can be populated with Library's cards as long as the 'max number' is not exceeded
        - Cards moving from FQ Library to FQ Deck creat a new card instead
        - Restrict rights in deck for players
        - Macro to automate the creation of a FQ Deck and a FQ Library (deck replaced and generated up to level 5, single-classed)
        - Handle different behavior out of combat (currentDrop, draw and pick cards)
    Chore:
    - Migration v13
        - Remove deprecated methods
        - Migration cards flags to FQ typed system object
    - Unit testing
    - Add test world

